<mxCell id="flowtxt" value="&lt;b&gt;Advisory flow:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; User asks Nexa / UI / Marketplace &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; Channel obtains Entra token (client credentials / OIDC) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt; Call MCP &lt;i&gt;recommend_vendor_products&lt;/i&gt; or REST &lt;i&gt;/advisory/recommend&lt;/i&gt; via APIM&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt; AuthN/Z + tenant context &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt; Orchestrator loads/creates tenant session &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt; Requirements: LLM extraction (taxonomy-constrained) ∪ deterministic → validated profile + clarification questions&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt; Recommendation Engine composes ranked bundles from the vendor pack (must-have coverage first, Avantra rules labelled) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt; Evidence: hybrid search per claim → citations + grades&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt; Licensing: disclosure + sizing inputs (no prices) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt; Grounded summary → Narrative Guard (fallback to template) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt; Persist session (Draft) + audit&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt; Return result with sessionId; follow-ups reuse it &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;13&lt;/b&gt; Reviewer approves (Advisory.Reviewer) &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;14&lt;/b&gt; Report generated: &quot;Approved for customer sharing&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ingestion:&lt;/b&gt; upload / job → parse → injection scan (quarantine) → chunk → classify → embed → SQL + Blob → publish (curator) → Azure AI Search" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="z7"><mxGeometry x="640" y="35" width="1860" height="185" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
